<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Coding in html for the first time.</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>This is the comment</h1>
    <h2>This is a subheading</h2>
    <p>This is a paragraph. now i am using the br tag. <br> this line will be break.</p>
    <pre>MY name is Mayank.

    </pre>


    <a href="https://www.w3schools.com/html/default.asp"> click here for W3 schools</a><!--jab tak link nahi denge tab tak nhi kam karega . hame visiting url dena hota hai in href.  -->


    
<p>List of items i have with me right now.</p>
<ol type="i"><!--type mai numbering kaisi hoti hai ye likhte hai-->
    <li>Mobile</li>
    <li>laptop</li><!--in ordered list numbering hota hai -->
    <li>charger
    </li> 
    <li>Headphones</li> 

</ol>
<ol type="i" start="9"><!--start mai kaha se numbering shuru karni hai ye likhte hai-->

    <li>laptop</li><!--in ordered list numbering hota hai -->
    <li>charger
    </li> 
    <li>Headphones</li>


</ol>
<ul type="square"><!--type mai bullet points kaisi hoti hai ye likhte hai , it can be square circle triangle like that-->
    <li>Mobile</li>
    <li>laptop</li><!--in ordered list numbering hota hai -->
    <li>charger
    </li> 
    <li>Headphones</li> 
</ul>

</body>

</html>   
